<title>USA: New Castle Cty, Del., may consolidate departments.</title>
<headline>New Castle Cty, Del., may consolidate departments.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Del. 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Castle County, Del., is considering a plan to consolidate services into six departments as part of an effort to cut operating costs.</p>
<p>County Finance Chairman Bob Woods said he is worried about the possible cutback in federal funds as the county works on its $143 million budget.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
